*  ============================================================================
*  CONTROL for the PB-1s per-site snapshot class (s107).  GREEN -- must stay green.
*  Each control removes exactly ONE ingredient from pb_selfref_alt_cycle.sno.
*  ============================================================================
*  INGREDIENT REMOVED: the ALT.  `mk = mk 'x'` lowers to IR_BINOP (binop=11) with NO
*  SNO$MKPAT and NO PAT$n$V cell -- the value is consumed eagerly, so no cycle exists.
*  This is what proves the ALT's role is to FORCE THE BLOB ROUTE, nothing more.
        mk = LEN(0)
        n = 0
LP      n = n + 1
        mk = mk 'x'
        LT(n,2)                         :S(LP)
        'xx' mk                         :F(NO)
        OUTPUT = 'MATCHED noalt'        :(FIN)
NO      OUTPUT = 'NOMATCH noalt'
FIN
END
